DESCRIPTION:National Bread Pudding Day falls on November 13 and marks a dis
 h that exists because bread goes stale. The observance itself has no trace
 able origin — no founding organization\, proclamation or first year appe
 ars in any reliable source — but the dish it names is among the better-d
 ocumented desserts in English and American cookbooks\, printed and reprint
 ed from the 1700s onward.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-
 bread-pudding-day/
